5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. I value a calm start. Let us observe carefully before acting.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,"Hi! I feel super excited. Trust is key, right? Who is the Seer?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Greetings. I am Mizuki. I will rely on logic and observation to guide us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello. I am Midori. I hope we can keep things friendly and harmonious.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Hey. I’m Takumi. Don’t be too soft. We need to be tough to survive.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Agreed. Suspicion is natural, but evidence is better. Let us listen to each other.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,@Takumi That sounds scary! But I like it. I have a hunch someone is hiding something.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,@Rin Hunches are dangerous. We need concrete inconsistencies in behavior to make a call.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Mizuki. Let’s not jump to conclusions. We are all friends here, right?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Midori Friends? Maybe. But wolves don’t care about feelings. Stay sharp, Midori.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,Takumi makes a fair point. Balance is needed. I will share my thoughts as they form.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Okay! I will ask lots of questions. Why did you say that, @Jonathan?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,@Rin I said that because I want to avoid emotional bias. Logic protects us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,I just want everyone to feel safe. Let’s support each other’s ideas gently.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,@Mizuki Logic is good. But sometimes you have to trust your gut. I trust mine.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,We will see. The night will bring information. Let us rest and reflect.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Rin,,Goodnight! I hope the Seer finds the wolf. I’m ready for adventure!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,Goodnight. I will analyze the first day’s actions closely. Stay vigilant.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Goodnight, everyone. I hope for a peaceful and fair game.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Night. Watch your backs. The wolf is always listening.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
