31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I have received my first divination. The result is clear. I will share it now.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Oh! You’re the Seer? Cool! Who did you check? Tell us, please!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,@Jonathan Please state the result. I will evaluate the implications based on the group’s reactions.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I am a bit nervous. Please, let’s handle this with care and kindness.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,@Jonathan Spill it. I’m not afraid of the truth. Let’s see who’s shaking.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I divined Takumi. The result is: Werewolf. I am certain of this.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,@Takumi No way! You’re the wolf? But you seemed so tough! I’m shocked!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,@Takumi Your reaction is immediate. I will observe your defense closely. Do not lie.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Oh no... I didn’t expect that. Takumi, please explain. I want to understand.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,@Jonathan You’re lying. I’m a Villager. You’re trying to frame me to save yourself.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I do not lie. My role is sacred. Takumi, your denial is expected, but it is futile.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,@Mizuki Do you believe Jonathan? I feel like Takumi is hiding something. His voice changed.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin I do not trust feelings. I trust the Seer’s word. Takumi, your denial is weak.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I feel conflicted. I liked Takumi, but if Jonathan is right, we must act.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,@Mizuki You’re just following the crowd. I’m brave. I don’t need your approval.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,The evidence is in my hand. I urge you to vote for Takumi. He is the threat.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Rin,,I’m voting for Takumi. I trust the Seer. Let’s keep the village safe!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. The logical conclusion is clear. Takumi is the Werewolf. Vote accordingly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I am sad, but I will follow the group. I hope this brings peace.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,@Jonathan You’re the real wolf. I’ll show you. I’m not going down without a fight.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
